{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日Anthropic聯合創始人、政策與公共事務負責人Jack Clark在訪談中提到對中國AI發展的判斷。<strong>他表示，中國模型目前落後西方約6個月到一年，\"模型太蠢\"，因此還沒有看到失控的智能體集羣，但再過幾個月，中方也將面對西方已經經歷過的同一套風險。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583654.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.454686+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:10:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"94aedfeecd6e8e0c7876e337089dc5bb9b9dbbe1b0af122e9e0b44024845596c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}